        with:
          name: playwright-html-report
          path: playwright-report/
          retention-days: 14
```

The blob filenames include the shard identity, so flattening them into one directory is intentional. Use the same lockfile/Playwright version on every shard and the merge job. The failure conditions above preserve and merge reports even when tests fail.

