## 2. Parallel tests are mutating the same server-side account

Separate browser contexts and copies of `storageState` **do not isolate backend settings**.

Keep `fullyParallel`, but give **each worker its own picker account**, and reset that account’s language before each test. Workers on different shards must also get different accounts.

Here is an example using five workers per shard and a separate pool of five accounts on each CI machine. The login/settings routes are application-specific; this example assumes login sets an authentication cookie.

**`tests/fixtures.ts`**
